"wands-13|swords-10":"A confident person can close a chapter fully: once the ending is complete, warmth and spine together make it possible to begin again.",
"wands-13|swords-11":"Self-possession meets a watchful question: a sure presence is free to ask, so use your warmth to invite honest answers.",
