"cups-10|pentacles-04":"A close circle can also become a fortress; belonging is richest when security protects people without closing the door on newcomers.",
"cups-10|pentacles-05":"Belonging answers the cold of being left out; reaching toward the circle you already have is the quiet remedy for feeling like an outsider.",
"cups-10|pentacles-06":"Generosity moving back and forth within a close circle keeps belonging fair; each person gives and receives so no one carries the whole load.",
"cups-10|pentacles-07":"Patient tending of a shared life pays off slowly; stepping back to assess what has grown will show how much belonging you have already built.",
"cups-10|pentacles-08":"Belonging is practiced, not just felt; the small acts repeated hour after hour are what turn a gathering of people into a home.",
"cups-10|pentacles-09":"A fulfilled shared life and personal independence can coexist; belonging does not require you to dissolve the comfortable self you built alone.",
"cups-10|pentacles-10":"Family and structures built to last lean on each other; belonging gives the legacy its warmth, and the legacy gives belonging its stability.",
"cups-10|pentacles-11":"A loving circle makes room for a learner; belonging helps a beginner's real attempt feel safe enough to try.",
"cups-10|pentacles-12":"Steady, dependable effort holds a household together; belonging is quietly maintained by whoever simply shows up, again and again.",
"cups-10|pentacles-13":"Warm belonging meets practical care; the home is made livable by capable hands that tend to meals, details, and the people around the table.",
"cups-10|pentacles-14":"A secure, well-provided life gives belonging room to breathe; competence on the material side lets the emotional side of a household relax.",
"cups-11|cups-12":"A gentle new feeling and a romantic offer move in the same direction; let the tender one set the speed so the invitation feels sincere, not staged.",
"cups-11|cups-13":"Early, delicate feeling is met by an emotional depth that already knows itself; the new sentiment can learn steadiness from the mature one.",
