"cups-11|swords-07":"A sincere feeling sits beside a sly strategy; ask which of the two is steering, since tenderness and scheming do not share one conversation well.",
"cups-11|swords-08":"A soft new feeling comes while your own mind holds you in place; let the heart's small message loosen what the story of being trapped has tied.",
