"cups-11|swords-10":"Something has ended completely, and a gentle feeling stirs in the quiet that remains; new tenderness can begin without erasing what finished.",
"cups-11|swords-11":"Tender curiosity meets cautious watching; ask the gentle question and observe the answer carefully, since feeling and scrutiny can sit at the same table.",
"cups-11|swords-12":"A shy, tender feeling is overrun by a fast, blunt one; ask whether speed is helping, because the delicate message needs time to be heard.",
"cups-11|swords-13":"A sweet new feeling meets a mind that refuses comforting lies; let the feeling be real by letting it face plain facts.",
"cups-11|swords-14":"A tender sentiment stands before a firm, principled judgement; the heart's message deserves fair weighing, not dismissal and not blind trust.",
"cups-11|pentacles-01":"A first stirring of feeling meets something solid and real; gentle emotion has a place to land, if you take the practical step to build on it.",
