"cups-11|pentacles-07":"A fresh feeling needs patience, not inspection; resist digging up the roots to see if it is growing, and let the slow season do its work.",
"cups-11|pentacles-08":"Tender feeling becomes something durable through practice; small, repeated acts of care, done without drama, turn a first spark into a habit of warmth.",
"cups-11|pentacles-09":"A tender message reaches someone who is already at home in their own life; the feeling can be welcomed as an addition, not as a rescue.",
"cups-11|pentacles-10":"A new, delicate feeling is set against something old and well established; ask gently how the fresh sentiment can find a place inside lasting commitments.",
