"cups-13|swords-01":"Deep feeling meets a sharp, clear thought; compassion gives truth a gentle landing, and truth keeps compassion from becoming a way of avoiding things.",
"cups-13|swords-02":"Steady feeling sits across from a mind that keeps its eyes covered; compassion cannot settle what the stalemate refuses to look at.",
