"cups-13|swords-04":"Gentle emotional depth finds the necessary quiet; letting the heart rest without having to understand everything is what restores its steadiness.",
"cups-13|swords-05":"Deep feeling stands in the aftermath of a sour win; compassion asks what was lost in the contest, even if the argument is technically settled.",
"cups-13|swords-06":"Emotional steadiness travels well toward calmer water; a heart that stays grounded can carry its own weather through a difficult transition.",
"cups-13|swords-07":"Intuitive feeling picks up on something done quietly and out of view; trust the sense that something is off, then gather facts before you act on it.",
"cups-13|swords-08":"A deep, steady heart meets a mind that has tied its own hands; compassion helps, but loosening the knots is an act of thought as well as feeling.",
