"cups-13|swords-12":"Calm emotional depth meets a fast, blunt force; the steadier energy does not need to match the speed, only to hold its ground and speak honestly.",
"cups-13|swords-13":"Compassion meets unsentimental clarity: one softens truth, the other sharpens it, and the best result is honesty said with real care.",
"cups-13|swords-14":"Emotional depth meets principle and fair judgement; feeling informs the ruling, and the ruling gives feeling a form it can safely stand on.",
"cups-13|pentacles-01":"Deep, steady feeling meets something solid and workable; compassion becomes more useful when it is given a practical place to land.",
"cups-13|pentacles-02":"Emotional steadiness is tested by a juggled week; care for others holds up better when you also keep a little attention for your own balance.",
"cups-13|pentacles-03":"Deep feeling joins a team doing careful work; emotional intelligence is a craft too, and it makes a shared effort run more smoothly.",
"cups-13|pentacles-04":"A steady, feeling heart meets a tight hold on security; compassion invites you to loosen your grip without pretending that caution has no value.",
"cups-13|pentacles-05":"Emotional depth reaches toward someone out in the cold; compassion should be practical here, offering warmth and shelter along with sympathy.",
"cups-13|pentacles-06":"Deep feeling shapes fair exchange; giving works best when it is honest and attentive, and receiving works best when it is allowed without guilt.",
"cups-13|pentacles-07":"Quiet, intuitive feeling pauses at the edge of the field; trust your read of how the long effort is going, and decide with a settled heart.",
"cups-13|pentacles-08":"Emotional depth is refined through repetition; the daily practice of listening and steadying yourself is a skill that can be improved like any other.",
"cups-13|pentacles-09":"A deeply feeling person at home in a garden of their own making; self-sufficiency and compassion go together when you tend yourself as well as others.",
"cups-13|pentacles-10":"Deep feeling feeds something meant to outlast you; emotional steadiness is what lets a family or lasting structure be warm as well as secure.",
"cups-13|pentacles-11":"Intuitive depth meets a student of practical things; feeling gives the learning a purpose, and the studying gives the feeling something useful to do.",
"cups-13|pentacles-12":"Steady feeling is paired with steady effort; both are quiet and neither seeks applause, and together they make a very reliable kind of care.",
