"cups-13|pentacles-14":"Emotional depth meets material competence; one understands what people feel, the other understands what they need to live, and they strengthen each other.",
"cups-14|swords-01":"Emotion under command meets a clear, cutting thought; kindness and honesty work as a pair when the truth is said calmly and without cruelty.",
"cups-14|swords-02":"Composed feeling meets a refusal to look; a calm heart can wait, but it cannot decide for someone who keeps their eyes covered.",
