"cups-14|swords-06":"Emotion held in good order eases a move toward calmer water; keeping your composure through the transition is what makes the passage gentle.",
"cups-14|swords-07":"Mature emotional control meets a quiet scheme; stay kind, but keep your eyes open, since goodwill does not need to be naive.",
"cups-14|swords-08":"A composed, kind heart meets the story of being stuck; steadiness helps you question the account you tell yourself, gently and without scolding.",
