"cups-14|swords-10":"Emotional steadiness meets an ending that is completely done; a composed heart can acknowledge the loss without letting it set the terms for what comes next.",
"cups-14|swords-11":"Kindness with judgement meets a watchful questioner; mature feeling welcomes honest questions, since a steady heart has little to hide and much to explain.",
"cups-14|swords-12":"Calm emotional command meets a blunt, rushing force; the steadier energy sets the tone, and a kind firmness can slow the charge without shaming it.",
"cups-14|swords-13":"Compassion with limits meets unsparing clear sight; together they can say hard things with care, and that is rarer than either quality alone.",
"cups-14|swords-14":"Mature feeling meets fair-minded principle; heart and mind agree on the shape of a decision when kindness is not asked to excuse everything.",
"cups-14|pentacles-01":"Emotional maturity meets a solid, workable opening; a steady heart can build on it, because it neither grabs nor flinches at a good start.",
"cups-14|pentacles-02":"Emotional composure meets a juggled life; keeping your temper level is half of keeping all the balls in the air.",
"cups-14|pentacles-03":"A kind, composed manner meets a team doing careful work; emotional maturity is the quiet reason a shared project stays on course.",
"cups-14|pentacles-04":"A generous heart meets a firm hold on security; mature feeling can be open without being careless, and cautious without being closed.",
"cups-14|pentacles-05":"Steady, kindly feeling meets the cold of scarcity; compassion with good judgement offers help that is sensible, so it warms someone rather than just soothing a conscience.",
