"swords-02|swords-06":"Stuck eyes covered, the way out is a gentle, deliberate move; you do not have to resolve the argument to leave the tense ground behind.",
"swords-02|swords-07":"A refusal to look meets quiet maneuvering; what you decline to see can be used by someone else, so uncover your eyes enough to notice what is moving.",
