"swords-02|pentacles-04":"Two forms of holding on meet, one a guarded heart and one a guarded purse; ask what you are protecting, and whether the guard is still needed.",
"swords-02|pentacles-05":"A standoff meets the cold of scarcity; fear of making the wrong move keeps you outside, and making any move at all may bring you in.",
