"swords-04|swords-06":"Rest and a gentle crossing belong together; you are leaving rough conditions for calmer ones, and the stillness of the trip is part of the healing.",
"swords-04|swords-07":"Rest is genuine here, yet quiet scheming goes on around it; take the pause, but keep one eye on what is being done while you are not looking.",
