"swords-04|swords-09":"A deliberate stop meets the sleepless night; real rest is the answer to a spiraling mind, and it needs to be chosen before exhaustion forces it.",
"swords-04|swords-10":"After something has fully ended, the body and mind ask for quiet; resting here is not weakness but the sensible response to a hard finish.",
