"swords-04|swords-13":"A quiet retreat meets clear, honest sight; stepping back from the noise lets you see what is true, without the pressure to react to it.",
"swords-04|swords-14":"Rest meets measured judgement; a decision made after a real pause tends to be fairer than one made while tired and under pressure.",
"swords-04|pentacles-01":"A needed stop meets a solid new opening; the opportunity will keep for a day or two, and you will meet it better rested.",
