"swords-08|pentacles-11":"A beginner's willingness to study and try something real is the best medicine for feeling stuck, because small attempts break a rigid story.",
"swords-08|pentacles-12":"Steady, unglamorous steps are the way out of a trap built from thought, and walking beats analyzing what the blindfold hides.",
"swords-08|pentacles-13":"Practical care is a counter to self-imprisonment: a capable, warm hand will help you loosen the knots and get something done.",
