"swords-10|swords-12":"Hitting bottom leaves little to defend, and a blunt, charging energy can finally say what was never said, if it does so without cruelty.",
"swords-10|swords-13":"A complete ending is easiest to face alongside someone who will not sugarcoat it, because clear sight turns raw pain into plain understanding.",
